### El microservicio recibe la petición en 8080 y consume la API en 8181
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/security/log
x-api-version: apiversion
x-channel-id: channel
x-originating-appl-code: originating
x-country-code: country
Content-Type: application/json

< ./audit-request.json

### Salud del microservicio consumidor
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
